<%#
  Cover fallback: a quiet, icon-led placeholder on Vellum, rendered beneath a
  cover <img>. Shows through when no image exists (server side) or when the
  img fails at runtime (image-fallback hides the broken img).

  Icons come from the shared icon set (icons/*.svg → shared/icons/_*.html.erb
  via `rake theme:generate`), so placeholders match the navigation icons.

  Locals:
    - icon: String, an icon partial name in shared/icons ("library", "clubs")
    - size_class: font-size utility that sets the icon size (icon is 1em),
      defaults to text-5xl
%>
<% size_class = local_assigns[:size_class].presence || "text-5xl" %>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-background text-content-muted <%= size_class %>">
  <%= render "shared/icons/#{icon}", classes: "h-[1em] w-[1em]" %>
</div>
